### Create a tracker
POST http://localhost:8080/api/trackers
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Games" }

### Add media (201)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/trackers/1/media
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Celeste", "type": "GAME", "length": null, "priority": 2 }

### Same name again (409)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/trackers/1/media
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Celeste", "type": "GAME" }

### Tracker doesn't exist (404)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/trackers/999/media
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Hades", "type": "GAME" }

### Invalid type (400)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/trackers/1/media
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Hades", "type": "PODCAST" }

### Delete media 1 (expect 204)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/media/1

### Delete it again (expect 404)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/media/1

### Check the tracker's media count dropped
GET http://localhost:8080/api/trackers

### Get one tracker (expect 200)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/trackers/1

### Get a tracker that doesn't exist (expect 404)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/trackers/999

### Non-numeric ID (expect 400)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/trackers/abc
### ---------- Media: read, edit, logs ----------
### Run "Create a tracker" and "Add media (201)" first after a restart

### List a tracker's media (expect 200)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/trackers/1/media

### List media for a missing tracker (expect 404)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/trackers/999/media

### Get one media with its logs (expect 200)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/media/1

### Get missing media (expect 404)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/media/999

### Edit rating and status (expect 200)
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/media/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "rating": 9, "status": "HOLD" }

### Rating out of range (expect 400)
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/media/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "rating": 15 }

### Blank name (expect 400)
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/media/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "   " }

### Log a viewing (expect 201, status becomes VIEWING)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/media/1/logs
Content-Type: application/json

{ "viewedOn": "2026-11-10", "viewProgress": 5 }

### Log a viewing in the future (expect 400)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/media/1/logs
Content-Type: application/json

{ "viewedOn": "2099-01-01", "viewProgress": 5 }

### Log with missing progress (expect 400)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/media/1/logs
Content-Type: application/json

{ "viewedOn": "2026-11-10" }

### Remove the latest log (expect 200)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/media/1/logs/latest

### Remove when there are no logs left (expect 404)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/media/1/logs/latest

### ---------- Filtering a tracker's media ----------
### Filters are optional and combined with AND. Unrated media are excluded when a rating bound is given.

### Filter by status (expect 200)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/trackers/1/media?status=VIEWING

### Filter by type and minimum rating (expect 200)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/trackers/1/media?type=GAME&minRating=7

### Rating range (expect 200)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/trackers/1/media?minRating=3&maxRating=8

### Invalid status (expect 400)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/trackers/1/media?status=BORED

### Rating out of range (expect 400)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/trackers/1/media?minRating=11

### minRating greater than maxRating (expect 400)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/trackers/1/media?minRating=8&maxRating=3
